<title>SWITZERLAND: SNB says leaves discount rate unchanged.</title>
<headline>SNB says leaves discount rate unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank (SNB) said it left its discount rate unchanged at 1.00 percent after a meeting of its three-member board.</p>
<p>&quot;Nothing has changed,&quot; an SNB spokesman said.</p>
<p>The SNB last changed its discount rate on September 26, when the rate was lowered to 1.00 percent from 1.50 percent. -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
